      "title": "sharkd: Add \"comments\" field to \"frames\" method",
      "message": "sharkd: Add \"comments\" field to \"frames\" method\n\nUpdate `sharkd`'s `frames` method to include a `comments` string array\ncontaining the comments for a frame.  The existing boolean `ct` field,\nwhich is `true` if the frame has one or more comments, has not been\nmodified.  Like the existing `ct` field, the new `comments` field is\nonly included in the response if the frame has comments.  A new\n`test_sharkd_req_frames_comments` unit test has been added to verify\nthe functionality of the new `comments` field.\n",
